{"id":55240,"date":"2026-07-28T17:28:57","date_gmt":"2026-07-28T16:28:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/utmb-mont-blanc\/"},"modified":"2026-09-07T08:44:28","modified_gmt":"2026-09-07T07:44:28","slug":"utmb-mont-blanc","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/utmb-mont-blanc\/","title":{"rendered":"UTMB Mont-Blanc 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 1: Descri\u00e7\u00e3o Geral --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">Sobre a <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">UTMB Mont-Blanc 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n    O UTMB Mont-Blanc \u00e9 a m\u00edtica final mundial do circuito Dacia UTMB World Series, reunindo os melhores atletas de Trail Running do planeta \u00e0 volta do maci\u00e7o do Mont-Blanc.\n  <\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Planeia a tua corrida com a nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e explora o <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calendario-de-corridas\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">calend\u00e1rio de corridas de Portugal<\/a>.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 2: Ficha T\u00e9cnica --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">\u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica do <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Evento<\/span><\/h3>\n<ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 14px;\">\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 Data Oficial:<\/strong><span style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">24 a 30 de Agosto de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px;\">\ud83d\udccd Localiza\u00e7\u00e3o:<\/strong><span style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">Chamonix-Mont-Blanc (Fran\u00e7a \/ It\u00e1lia \/ Su\u00ed\u00e7a)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Dist\u00e2ncias:<\/strong><span style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">UTMB 171 km, CCC 100 km, OCC 55 km, PTL 300 km, ETC 15 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px;\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Tipo de Piso:<\/strong><span style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">Trilhos de alta montanha alpina, neve, rocha e vales dos Alpes<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px 10px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px;\">\ud83d\udc65 Organiza\u00e7\u00e3o:<\/strong><span style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-word; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;\">UTMB Group \/ Dacia UTMB Mont-Blanc<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 3: Geometria da Prova --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Geometria da Prova &amp; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Percurso<\/span><\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    O percurso rainha (171 km com 10.000m D+) atravessa Fran\u00e7a, It\u00e1lia e Su\u00ed\u00e7a, subindo a colos alpinos acima dos 2.500 metros de altitude.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 4: Banner Calculadora --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card pr-calc-event-banner\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0%, rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.05) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h4 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 700;\">\u23f1\ufe0f Calcula o teu Pace para a <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Prova<\/span><\/h4>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Gere o esfor\u00e7o ideal e calcula os teus tempos de prova.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 0%, #8B5CF6 100%); color: #1E1B4B; font-weight: 800; padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 30px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;\">Abrir Calculadora de Pace \u2192<\/a><\/div>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 5: Onde Ficar --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">\ud83c\udfe8 Onde <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Ficar em Chamonix-Mont-Blanc (Fran\u00e7a \/ It\u00e1lia \/ Su\u00ed\u00e7a)<\/span><\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Hospedagem no centro de Chamonix-Mont-Blanc, Les Houches, Argenti\u00e8re ou Courmayeur (It\u00e1lia).\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 6: Sobre a Regi\u00e3o & Gastronomia --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">\ud83c\udf0d Sobre a Regi\u00e3o &amp; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Gastronomia<\/span><\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Desfruta da aut\u00eantica cozinha alpina savoyarde, com a tradicional Fondue Savoyarde, Raclette de Queijo Beaufort, Tartiflette e vinhos da Sab\u00f3ia.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- M\u00d3DULO 7: Perguntas Frequentes --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card pr-faq-section\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\">Frequentes<\/span><\/h3>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza o UTMB Mont-Blanc 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">A semana do evento realiza-se de 24 a 30 de Agosto de 2026 em Chamonix-Mont-Blanc.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde \u00e9 feita a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e sorteio de vagas s\u00e3o geridos centralmente no portal oficial em montblanc.utmb.world.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">Engloba as provas UTMB (171 km), CCC (100 km), OCC (55 km), PTL (300 km), TDS (145 km), YCC e ETC (15 km).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio necess\u00e1rio?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">O material obrigat\u00f3rio inclui manta t\u00e9rmica, casaco imperme\u00e1vel com capuz, sistema de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o, telem\u00f3vel oper\u00e1tico e duas lanternas frontais.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o acompanhamento e LiveTrail?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">O acompanhamento em tempo real de todos os atletas \u00e9 efetuado na plataforma LiveTrail e no canal UTMB Live.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde \u00e9 feito o levantamento dos dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">O levantamento dos dorsais decorre no Salon Ultra-Trail na Place du Mont-Blanc em Chamonix com controlo estrito de equipamento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 14px 18px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam os transportes de apoio?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza os UTMB Buses que ligam todas as zonas de partida, pontos de apoio a acompanhantes e locais de retorno.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\"