 os atletas \u00e9 efetuado na plataforma LiveTrail e no canal UTMB Live.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde \u00e9 feito o levantamento dos dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento dos dorsais decorre no Salon Ultra-Trail na Place du Mont-Blanc em Chamonix com controlo estrito de equipamento.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funcionam os transportes de apoio?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza os UTMB Buses que ligam todas as zonas de partida, pontos de apoio a acompanhantes e locais de retorno.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":55241,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,497,622,498,499],"event_type_2":[627,1439],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-55240","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-chamonix-franca","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-endurance","event_type-trail-longo","event_type-trail-ultra","event_type_2-europa","event_type_2-franca"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Affiche-UTMB-Mont-Blanc-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/55240","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=55240"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp